// Clinton County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Board of Elections,
// the Auditor's search, United Way and the News Journal) were checked in a
// browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Village of Lynchburg is in HIGHLAND County (its own site says so) and is
//     removed. Caesar Creek State Park is mostly in Warren County and is removed.
//   * The Auditor's site is clintoncountyauditor.org (ISSG); the old Schneider-
//     hosted site stopped updating in March 2024.
//   * Probate and Juvenile courts have their own pages on clintoncountycourts.org.
//   * Clinton Memorial Hospital is TriHealth Clinton Regional Hospital; Kettering
//     Health now runs a Wilmington site (its emergency center is listed as
//     temporarily closed). Community Care Hospice is an Ohio's Hospice affiliate.
//   * Wilmington's city site is wilmingtonohio.gov (wilmingtonoh.org is stale).
//   * WALH is now internet-only; WKFI (Real Roots Radio) and WIOH-LP are licensed
//     to Wilmington.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Clinton County NY/PA/IA/IL/MI/IN; Wilmington DE/NC (UNC Wilmington,
//   Wilmington University). Energize Clinton County is no longer active; the Port
//   Authority leads economic development.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Wilmington), seven villages (only Blanchester, Sabina and New
//     Vienna have sites) and thirteen townships, none with a site.
//   * The Southern Ohio ESC is in Wilmington; Laurel Oaks (Great Oaks) is the
//     career campus; Southern State offers aviation programs there.
//   * The mental-health board serves Warren and Clinton together.
//   * Several neighbouring-county districts reach into Clinton, but no
//     first-party source confirmed which, so none is listed.
//
// LEFT OUT rather than listed unverified: township sites (none found), the
// Recorder's Fidlar search and building-permit portal (did not load), the Humane
// Society, Banana Split Festival and Sugartree Ministries (no own sites), and
// private businesses.

